   ],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "How the reference pictures align with the target video \u2014 Picture 1 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 0.00-second mark of the target video; Picture 2 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 8.71-second mark of the target video.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, realistic UGC iPhone selfie video, vertical 9:16, one continuous handheld front-camera take with a subtle natural sway, small arm micro-jitters, autofocus gently re-focusing and natural exposure shifts. Real unretouched skin with visible pores, fine lines and natural shine, flyaway hairs and mild phone-camera noise. The shot begins in the position and framing established by Picture 1: a warm, relatable American woman in her fifties, with shoulder-length brown hair worn down and a soft blue cardigan, in her bright kitchen in soft morning light, standing at the counter. A plain white unlabeled pill jar stands on the counter in front of her, in the lower right of the frame. Her phone hand stretches toward the lens at the lower left edge of the frame; that phone is the camera. Her free hand rests on the counter beside the jar. [0.2s-4.6s] The woman on screen, with a warm, slightly husky female voice, a calm and honest conversational delivery and a General American accent, with tiny breaths between phrases (S1), gives a deadpan look straight into the lens, one eyebrow slowly rising, and says in a low, dry tone: <d>[English] Okay, real talk, most magnesium I tried did nothing for me.</d> She closes her lips. [4.9s-8.1s] She (S1) leans in a little toward the lens, her free hand resting on the counter, and says: <d>[English] So I stopped guessing and started reading labels.</d> She closes her lips. [8.1s-8.7s] She holds a dry, serious look into the lens with her lips together, her free hand resting on the counter beside the jar, settling into the pose, spacing and framing established by Picture 2. Her face stays dry and serious throughout. The woman stays the same person with natural hands for the whole shot, and everything important stays in the center of the frame.\n\noverall_soundscape: Close iPhone microphone audio with a slightly compressed, room-echoey voice, quiet kitchen room tone in the morning, a faint fridge hum, birds faint outside the window, a soft rustle of her cardigan.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A"
   ],
   "title": "PROMPT \u00b7 take 1 in MiniMax's format (`take_graph.py --print-prompt`)",
   "color": "#223",
   "bgcolor": "#335"
  },
